   ✓ @ symbol in attributes does not break requests
   ✓ @ symbol in attributes does not break attribute settling requests
   ✓ selected element with ID does not cause NPE when it disappears
   ✓ does not submit with a false condition on a form
   ✓ two elements can listen for the same event on another element
