   ✓ swap=outerHTML clears htmx-swapping class when old node has a style attribute and no class
   ✓ swap=outerHTML won't carry over user-defined classes when old node has a style attribute before the class attribute
   ✓ a button clicked inside an htmx enabled link will prevent the link from navigating on click
   ✓ a htmx enabled button clicked inside a link will prevent the link from navigating on click
   ✓ a htmx enabled button containing sub elements will prevent the button submitting a form
   ✓ a htmx enabled element inside a form button will prevent the button submitting a form
   ✓ from: trigger on form prevents default form submission
   ✓ from: trigger on button prevents default form submission
   ✓ from: trigger on link prevents default navigation
   ✓ check deleting button during click does not trigger exception error in getRelatedFormData when button can no longer find form

